      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "A magazine is built in two steps in the same Ammo Press. First press empty magazines: two steel plates, eight small steel springs and Mechanical Parts T2 make eight. Then fill them: four empties and twelve 9mm bullets make four loaded magazines.\n\nYou can also fill one by hand: put an empty magazine and three 9mm bullets together in a crafting grid. The press is just faster, and the pipes in the Ammo Logistics chapter can run it for you.\n\n[note]A loaded pistol magazine holds eighteen rounds. Sneak and right-click it to take the bullets back out.[/note]",
